  "chain": "inadequate FIP oversight / unvalidated engineering judgement [cause X] -> DRU intermittent failure (initially misdiagnosed as corroded relay connections) -> 2AB EDG fails to reach required frequency -> 2AB EDG inoperable 64+ days, exceeding LCO 3.8.1 completion time -> concurrent redundant 2CD EDG inoperability windows -> potential prevention of safety function fulfillment",
