  ],
  "notes": "Initial root-cause investigation misattributed the 5/21/2024 failure to corroded relay connections; re-evaluation after the 7/23/2024 recurrence identified an intermittent DRU failure as the true cause of both events, retroactively extending the inoperability window back to 5/21/2024 21:15. Cause code X (Other) governs category per form data, reflecting the human-performance/process root cause (failure investigation process lacked oversight) rather than a hardware cause code. Five 2CD EDG inoperability windows and associated supported-system declaration lapses are captured in the safety-function consequence node per 50.73(a)(2)(v); PRA assessment found risk within 'Very Low Safety Significance' per NRC IMC 0609. No previous similar events found in 5-year LER review, so no SIMILAR_TO edge/stub LER emitted."
